  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MR-F 2022-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MR-F 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att bidra till en lokalt driven utveckling vilket kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras genom kapacitetsst&#xe4;rkande st&#xf6;d till fr&#xe4;mst civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer men &#xe4;ven andra akt&#xf6;rer. Metoder f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; programm&#xe5;len &#xe4;r institutionellt st&#xf6;d, kapacitetsst&#xe4;rkande insatser, nationella och internationella utbyten samt dokumentation och studier. &#xc4;garskap och delaktighet &#xe4;r centrala komponenter i programmet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to contribute to locally driven development, which will be implemented through capacity-enhancing support to mainly civil society organisations but also other actors. Methods for achieving programme objectives include institutional support, capacity-enhancing efforts, national and international exchanges, and documentation and studies. Ownership and participation are key components of the program.</narrative>
  </description>
